# Generated diagrams: never hand-merge them.
#
# docs/diagrams/*.svg is build output — the render-puml.yml Action re-renders it
# from the .puml sources on every push. When two branches have each been rendered,
# git cannot merge the XML and every merge conflicts on all three files.
#
# `merge=ours` keeps the current branch's copy and resolves the conflict silently;
# the Action then overwrites it with a fresh render from the merged .puml sources,
# which are the actual source of truth.
#
# Requires a one-time setup per clone (git will not run repo-supplied commands):
#     git config merge.ours.driver true
docs/diagrams/*.svg merge=ours -diff
